Package: hikvision-sadp-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mnxx29 <https://github.com/Mnxx29>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt6, iproute2
Recommends: ufw, libcap2-bin
Homepage: https://github.com/Mnxx29/Hikvision-SADP-GUI-Linux
Description: Hikvision SADP GUI Tool for Linux
 A full-featured native Linux graphical interface (PyQt6) alternative
 to Hikvision's official SADP Tool. Discovers, configures, and manages
 Hikvision IP cameras, NVRs, DVRs, and intercoms on your local network
 and across subnets without Wine.
